<h1>Your character is ready, <%= @user.name %>!</h1>

<p>
  We generated the character <strong><%= @character.name %></strong> for your
  project <strong><%= @project.name %></strong>. Please review it and approve it
  before you start generating videos.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @approve_url %>">Approve this character</a>
  &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <a href="<%= @reject_url %>">Reject and give feedback</a>
</p>

<p>Or open the review page:</p>
<p><a href="<%= @review_url %>"><%= @review_url %></a></p>

<p>
  This secure link can be used once and expires
  <%= @expires_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y at %H:%M UTC") %>. If the character isn't
  quite right, reject it with feedback and regenerate a new one — no video can be
  generated until a character is approved.
</p>
